<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίχειρον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>arm,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Je.</u>
				31
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				48
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in pl.,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίχειρα</span></b> , τά, prop. <i>wages of manual labour</i> :
			hence, <i>wages, pay,</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of <i>reward,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				581
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				18.8
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετῆς ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					608c
				</span></i>
			 ; ironically in <i><span class="en">
				D.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				3.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.12.5
			</span></i>, etc.: rarely in sg., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				38.3.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> more freq. of
				<i>punishment,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιαῦτα τῆς ὑψηγόρου γλώσσης..
					τἀπίχειρα γίγνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					321
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				1.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.24.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.512
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς προπετείας πικρὰ κομίζονται τἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ir.</u>
					p.32
				</span></i>
			 W.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξιφέων ἐ. λαχοῦσα</span>
			<i>the wages</i> of the sword, i.e. slaughter by it, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				820
			</span></i> (lyr.). (Sts. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχείρια</span> in codd., vulg. in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Praec.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.)</div>
